om/member/18330-redspieder","name":"Redspieder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18330_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T11:07:11-07:00","id":1223961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1223917-how-does-one-deal-with-ghosts?p=1223955#post1223955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Right. Was just checking because I thought there were rules for banishing at least in the GMC update, which could also half update Geist to 2e</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah banishing in GMC has to do with dismantling Manifestation conditions if i remember right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T11:28:10-07:00","id":1223966,"title":"","content":"Yep. Ghosts are constantly being dragged down to the Underworld by default and they spend Essence at least once every day (I believe) to resist that pull. Take away their ability to regain essence, they're going down to the Underworld in the next week or so for your average Rank 1 or 2 natural ghost. It's longer for more powerful ghosts, but those are far more rare, as only the Underworld can increase a ghost's Rank, and even a ghost who comes back up a century later needs mortal ritualists to give it powerful artificial Anchors to keep it from being dragged back down to the Underworld.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 06-01-2018, 02:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T11:57:09-07:00","id":1223973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1223917-how-does-one-deal-with-ghosts?p=1223966#post1223966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep. Ghosts are constantly being dragged down to the Underworld by default and they spend Essence at least once every day (I believe) to resist that pull. Take away their ability to regain essence, they're going down to the Underworld in the next week or so for your average Rank 1 or 2 natural ghost. It's longer for more powerful ghosts, but those are far more rare, as only the Underworld can increase a ghost's Rank, and even a ghost who comes back up a century later needs mortal ritualists to give it powerful artificial Anchors to keep it from being dragged back down to the Underworld.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Okay, yeah, I got a lot of reading to do. I feel bad for my ST, he decided to do a crossover chronicle where everyone is a different supernatural and allowed me to be a Sin-Eater. He has so much he needs to keep up with, I need to try to learn as much as I can to help him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18330-redspieder","name":"Redspieder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18330_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}